📁 3. Stop Ollama (important)
systemctl stop ollama

or Docker:

docker stop ollama

4. Copy models to server

You can also archive models:

sudo tar -czvf ollama-models.tar.gz \
/var/lib/docker/volumes/self-hosted-ai-starter-kit_ollama_storage/_data

Then transfer:

scp ollama-models.tar.gz user@server:/root/

5. On server start Ollama
ollama list

If everything is correct, model will appear immediately.

Extract on server:

tar -xzf ollama-models.tar.gz -C ~/.ollama/
